#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: backupsettingspage.ui:20
msgid "Backup Path"
msgstr "Ruta da copia de seguranza"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: backupsettingspage.ui:26
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Please choose a file for the backup. Make sure that enough hard disk space "
"is available."
msgstr ""
"Escolla un ficheiro para a copia e verifique que dispón de espazo de abondo "
"no disco duroo."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:45 backupwizardpages.cpp:77 backupwizardpages.cpp:254
#: backupwizardpages.cpp:310 backupwizardpages.cpp:354
msgid "Nepomuk Backup"
msgstr "Copia de seguranza de Nepomuk"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:46
msgid "Please choose one of the following options"
msgstr "Escolla unha destas opcións"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:78
msgid "Performing backup"
msgstr "Estase a facer a copia de seguranza"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Writing Nepomuk database backup to <filename>%1</filename>..."
msgstr ""
"Estase a escribir a copia de seguranza da base de datos de Nepomuk en "
"<filename>%1</filename>..."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Backup of the Nepomuk database successfully written to <filename>%1</"
"filename>."
msgstr ""
"A copia de seguranza da base de datos de Nepomuk escribiuse con éxito en "
"<filename>%1</filename>."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:113
msgid "Backup completed successfully"
msgstr "A copia de seguranza completouse con éxito"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:137
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No system backups found. Please select a custom backup path."
msgstr ""
"Non se atopou ningunha copia de seguranza do sistema. Escolla unha ruta "
"personalizada para a copia."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:197 backupwizardpages.cpp:204
msgid "Restoring Backup"
msgstr "Estase a repor a copia de seguranza"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:205
msgid "The backup is being restored..."
msgstr "Estase a restaurar a copia de seguranza..."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:255
msgid "Please configure the Nepomuk backup"
msgstr "Configure a copia de seguranza de Nepomuk"

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:311
msgid ""
"The following files were not found. Please either discard them or find them "
"manually"
msgstr "Non se atoparon os seguintes ficheiros. Descárteos ou búsqueos por si."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:355
#| msgid "The backup is being restored..."
msgid "The Backup has been successfully restored"
msgstr "A copia de seguranza restaurouse con éxito"

#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWizardPage, ErrorPage)
#: errorpage.ui:14
msgid "WizardPage"
msgstr "WizardPage"

#: fileconflictwidget.cpp:42
#| msgctxt "@action:button Discard the item in this row"
#| msgid "Discard"
msgid "Discard"
msgstr "Descartar"

#: fileconflictwidget.cpp:43
#| msgctxt "@action:button Resolve the conflict in this row"
#| msgid "Resolve..."
msgid "Resolve"
msgstr "Resolver"

#: fileconflictwidget.cpp:140
msgid "Find the url"
msgstr "Buscar o URL"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: intropage.ui:44
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Create a backup of the current Nepomuk database including all manually "
"created data. This backup can later be restored by choosing the "
"<interface>Restore</interface> option below."
msgstr ""
"Crea unha copia de seguranza da base de datos de Nepomuk incluíndo todos os "
"datos creados manualmente. Esta copia pode restaurarse posteriormente "
"escollendo a opción <interface>Restaurar</interface> en baixo."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: intropage.ui:120
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Restore an automated Nepomuk system backup or a manual backup created with "
"the <interface>Backup</interface> tool above."
msgstr ""
"Restaura unha copia de seguranza automática de Nepomuk ou unha manual creada "
"coa utilidade <interface>Copia de seguranza</interface> en riba."

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "NepomukBackup"
msgstr "NepomukBackup"

#: main.cpp:42
msgid "Nepomuk Backup Tool"
msgstr "Utilidade de copia de seguranza de Nepomuk"

#: main.cpp:44
msgid "(c) 2010, Nepomuk-KDE Team"
msgstr "(c) 2010, o equipo de Nepomuk-KDE"

#: main.cpp:47
msgid "Vishesh Handa"
msgstr "Vishesh Handa"

#: main.cpp:47
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Mantenedor"

#: main.cpp:48
msgid "Sebastian Trüg"
msgstr "Sebastian Trüg"

#: main.cpp:48
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "Desenvolvedor"

#: main.cpp:53
msgid "Start the application in backup mode"
msgstr "Iniciar o programa no modo de copia de seguranza"

#: main.cpp:54
msgid "Start the application in restore mode"
msgstr "Iniciar o programa no modo de restauración"

#: main.cpp:55
#| msgid "Start the application in restore mode"
msgid "Start the application in conflict resolution mode"
msgstr "Iniciar o programa no modo de resolución de conflitos"

#: main.cpp:76
#| msgctxt "@info"
#| msgid ""
#| "The Nepomuk backup service does not seem to be running. Backups cannot be "
#| "handled without it."
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Nepomuk does not seem to be running. Backups cannot be handled without it."
msgstr ""
"Nepomuk non semella estar a executarse, e non é posíbel manexar as copias sen "
"el."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QWizardPage, RestoreSelection)
#: restoreselection.ui:6
msgid "Restore Nepomuk Database"
msgstr "Restauración da base de datos de Nepomuk"

#. i18n: ectx: property (subTitle), widget (QWizardPage, RestoreSelection)
#: restoreselection.ui:9
msgid ""
"Please choose a backup from a list of known backups below. Or choose a "
"custom backup path."
msgstr ""
"Escolla a copia na lista de copias de seguranza coñecidas. Ou escolla unha "
"ruta personalizada."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: restoreselection.ui:18
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Please select one of the system backups generated by the Nepomuk backup "
"service or choose a custom backup file which has been created by this tool."
msgstr ""
"Escolla unha das copias de seguranza do sistema xeradas polo servizo de "
"copia de seguranza de Nepomuk ou escolla un ficheiro personalizado creado "
"con esta utilidade."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KPushButton, m_customBackupButton)
#: restoreselection.ui:53
msgid "Open Backup..."
msgstr "Abrir unha copia de seguranza..."

